## Backlog-facing workstreams

These are workstreams, not necessarily final item names.

### A. Goal burden and recursive ingredient burden
Already emerging from recipe/planning work.

### B. Baseline lifetime totals
Fixed denominators from zero mastery.

### C. Source catalog
Model source classes, applicability, overrides, seasonality, and default inclusion policy.

### D. User-provided source state
Model owned stockpiles, pet inventory, consumable state, and source toggles.

### E. Owned-source conversion engines
Examples:
- bags/chests
- stored pet inventory

### F. Exploring acquisition model and engine
Manual explore, cider, Lemonade, AP.

### G. Future pet production estimator
Simple “days left” style estimates.

### H. Unified acquisition planner
Combine goal burden, recursive ingredient burden, source policy, and acquisition engines.

